    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 62 Talbots Court presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-proportioned two-bedroom ground floor apartment in a mature and highly convenient residential setting on Freshford Road.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 2007, this attractive apartment extends to approximately 68.27 m² (735 sq. ft.) and offers well-balanced accommodation, making it an appealing choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a convenient city base.The property is also afforded parking which is provided on a first come first served basis.\r\n\r\nThe property is centred around a generous open-plan living and dining space, creating a bright and versatile area that is equally suited to everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen is well positioned off the living accommodation, providing a practical layout with excellent flow throughout the principal living space.\r\n\r\nThe apartment provides two comfortable bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite, while the additional bedroom is complemented by a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nFurther benefits include gas fired central heating and a BER rating of C2.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION;\r\nThe  c. 68.27 m2 of ground floor accommodation as seen in the attached photos, high quality video and virtual tour with accompanying 3D model & floorplan that accompanies this brochure.\r\n\r\nLOCATION;\r\nTalbot's Court is situated within the highly sought after Talbots Gate residential development along the Freshford Road, directly opposite St. Lukes County Hospital and UPMC Aut Even Hospital. Its  within walking distance of St. James' Park, Loreto and CBS Secondary Schools, as well as St Canice's Co-Ed Primary School. Kilkenny's Linear Park is on your doorstep whilst the City Centre is highly accessible and just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the convenience and quality of this superb location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Location within a mature sought after development \r\nSpacious ground floor apartment approximately 68.27 m² (735 sq. ft.)\r\nTwo spacious bedrooms (main with en-suite)\r\nLarge open plan kitchen/dining/living room.\r\nOwn door access\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nWithin walking distance of hospital, schools, and Kilkenny City centre amenities \r\nManagement Fees €1,100 per annum"
      },
